The first version of datixxia™ focuses on one task: exploring awarded public contracts by sector, location and period, and exporting the results.

{% split label="01 — The test" title="What you will" titleAccent="try first" image="/src/assets/img/home/dashboard.png" imageAlt="The datixxia™ dashboard with charts" %}
Search awards, compare sectors and follow changes over time in a simple dashboard.

Download the data or the charts for your own reports.
{% /split %}

{% split label="02 — Your role" title="How your feedback" titleAccent="shapes the platform" image="/src/assets/img/about/discovery-apple.jpg" imageAlt="Apples falling from a tree" reverse=true %}
Tell us which questions you could answer, which ones you could not, and what was missing.

Every round of feedback goes into the next release.
{% /split %}

{% takeaway text="The MVP is built with its first users — not just for them." /%}
